WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.780
- She's a teacher, a
community college professor,

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:05.530
a mamma, a grand mama, and oh, yep,

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:08.490
