up for president Biden

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:39.720
and like the Philly girl came out of you.

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:40.553
- [Jill] It did, yeah.

00:02:40.553 --> 00:02:41.920
- Yeah. Which I love, cause I-

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:44.170
Texas girls are just like
this photo by the way.

00:02:44.170 --> 00:02:45.003
- [Jill] Oh, good.

00:02:45.003 --> 00:02:45.836
- [Kelly] Yes, yes.

00:02:45.836 --> 00:02:47.700
- Yeah. Well, we protect
the people we love. Right?

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:48.640
- [Kelly] Absolutely.

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:50.670
And how often does she come out?

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:52.690
- Um, probably, hm,

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:54.080
every once in a while.

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:55.410
I mean, hopefully things like this

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:57.100
won't happen again and
now we have, you know

00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:59.760
the secret service to protect Joe, but uh,

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:02.070
you know, I think being from Philly it's.

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:02.903
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:03:02.903 --> 00:03:04.420
- I love that part of my growing up.

00:03:04.420 --> 00:03:06.790
And I think the people from
Philadelphia are strong

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:07.758
and tough and- uh.

00:03:07.758 --> 00:03:08.591
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:03:08.591 --> 00:03:09.760
- It's just a part of who I am.

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:13.180
I was actually just upstairs
watching the Villanova game.

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:15.750
So, you know, it never quite leaves me.

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:17.100
- Oh, so you're a serious
sports ball lover.

